── Semantic Cache Configuration ────────────────────────────────────
Copy this file to .env and fill in values
Similarity threshold (0.0 - 1.0, default: 0.95)
SEMCACHE_SIMILARITY_THRESHOLD=0.95
Enable adaptive thresholds per task type (default: true)
SEMCACHE_ENABLE_ADAPTIVE_THRESHOLD=true
Default TTL in seconds (default: 86400 = 24 hours)
SEMCACHE_DEFAULT_TTL_SECONDS=86400
Max cache entries before eviction (default: 10000)
SEMCACHE_MAX_CACHE_ENTRIES=10000
── Provider Settings ───────────────────────────────────────────────
OpenAI API key (leave empty to skip OpenAI, use Ollama only)
SEMCACHE_OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
Ollama base URL (default: http://localhost:11434)
SEMCACHE_OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
── Server Settings ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
Proxy listen port (default: 8000)
SEMCACHE_PROXY_PORT=8000